<description>&lt;p&gt;Landmines exploded in northwestern Idlib, killing four children and injuring two, while a separate mine-clearing operation in Deir ez-Zor killed a Syrian soldier and wounded two others. Lebanese forces seized 264 kilograms of explosives near the Syrian border and Syrian anti-narcotics officials destroyed a large captagon shipment, reflecting continued cross-border illicit trade. Russian air strikes hit Aleppo, killing three children. The United Nations recognized Syria’s anti-drug and anti-crime efforts, and 2,732 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Middle East Monitor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPd0lld3pCUUV0SjZHRkZGNUI3Ri1vYnBmZUJFYXZudXRURFR5LXk1VDhpc1dodE4xV2Rudzg0UlZ6SkNvenczemQ5cG14aHdqNjR6M2RMZ2QzdDdjUVBQRVNRTTY0aHRFWGVHUUtBWEdQZ2pFLTJtQ1hOaE10blJpNUY0NEdpYkVQZlMzTGp4LWF5SWJscElIazI3VkJPNVZrUU1EeUxkQ0o0c2hnTnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News PK&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPUnFieXVOb3U1QXBuMFFpaGxLSUhnZkFRQnhyVUZyM0NQRFZBYVk5ZGhsS2FKUGZCSjhwNk8tR0VISzJRMHZpYVo2OVVYUk1tSzNIQ1plbWhwMThUTUFGNUJpOEVWX0c0dHpKMUJxMDVwV09iSE9qak85cEoxUkM5UDNDTjRUTWFf?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haberler.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Enab Baladi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQd2ZhOWNkTzhZZF84TzhiNHktZ1lLbDVMWHAwbW0wVFk0Rm8zNUlWcFBKc01Yd1lWcTh5eEZLdTNzZDZxZ3lNTFZRRWZIX0M4VExUN3J1NVBuVDVSTlYtc3BsYzE1dUsyZS16bnV3QWtueE1mMVhRRGtxNlpKVXk2RmxrR3F4UG5MTmlOcUFFakFjQS1uYVhsUkdkVWVCWTAtZ1BvLXJocUVraWs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Syria Direct&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxPaXRMdWM0WDhBU2RDVXlXalhhQXhsaURiVVVyak11UnBHcllPVm5tZ1FYcnI5SmNITThPSGtCYzJaajZyR1ls